      "Designed service boundaries, API gateways, and CI/CD pipelines for a distributed system.",
    href: "/projects/monolith-to-microservices/",
    image: retroDeploy,
    imageAlt: "An isometric illustration of a green-lit server room",
    badgeLabel: "[Complete]",
    badgeVariant: "success",
    cta: "View",
  },
  {
    title: "Open source CLI tool with 2k+ stars on GitHub",
    description:
      "A Node.js CLI that automates dev workflows and ships with zero-config support for TypeScript and Docker.",
    href: "/projects/open-source-cli/",
    image: cliQuest,
    imageAlt: "A retro terminal running a text adventure on a CRT monitor",
    badgeLabel: "[Complete]",
    badgeVariant: "success",
    cta: "View",
  },
  {
    title: "Building a web-based observability dashboard",
